        {
          "text": "U-Aseli wayenamadodana ayisithupha, amagama awo la: ngo-Azirikam, noBhokeru, no-Ishmayeli, noShehariya, no-Obhadiya, noHanani. Bonke babengamadodana ka-Aseli.",
